<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 2.62 bln levs 9-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 2.62 bln levs 9-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed</p>
<p>2.62 billion levs of nine-day discount T-bills, yielding 4.80</p>
<p>percent to maturity, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the BNB did not say with which financial institution or institutions the issue was placed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Price is in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		   BG 3011297002</p>
<p> Par value			2.62 bln levs</p>
<p> Issue date		     January 14, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		  January 23, 1997</p>
<p> Selling price		  95.42 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	    4.80 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
</text>
